# each voice's own pages: its page button pressed again steps through FM, Env, Mod and Mod 2 and back (from the
# pad, the bells and the bass, never from the other pages); SELECT reaches them after Setup; their knobs, each voice's
# own (parN: amb.h, P_VOX 30, a block of 15 a voice), kept with the piece
wait 300
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 1
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 7
shot pad_fm.png
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 8
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 9
shot mod.png
# the pad's Depth: Garden's recipe 20, the bells' and the bass's untouched
turn K1 3 10
expect par37 23
expect par52 20
expect par67 20
# its Shape: Garden's a sine; Square
turn K3 4 10
expect par39 4
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 10
shot mod2.png
# Sync: Tempo
turn K3 2 10
expect par43 2
tap ENV
wait 100
expect view 1
# the bells: their FM page, the patch (Vibes)
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 2
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 11
turn K1 1 10
expect par28 1
# the bass: its FM page, Index +2 dB
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 3
tap LFO
wait 100
expect view 15
turn K3 2 10
expect par61 2
# another voice's button from a voice's page: that voice's own first page
tap ARP
wait 100
expect view 2
tap SEQ
wait 100
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 4
tap HOME
wait 100
tap HOME
wait 100
expect view 0
tap GLO
wait 100
turn SELECT 1 100
expect view 7
# the pad's Feedback, on its FM page
turn K4 2 10
expect par32 2
wav mod.wav
wait 20000
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
# kept with the piece
turn PRESET 1
turn PRESET -1
expect par28 1
expect par37 23
